author=Rohit Sharma (ROHITSHARMA838888)
description=Archer and WN722N callback fixes, WN monitor-state fix and LED support; each passed one owned-hotspot probe test (29/30 replies), no reboot. Matching 88XXau and 8188eu autoload plus unplug-restoring guard for the ROM USB reset loop. Exact Archer/WN722N v2-v3 IDs only. No ROM overlay or HAL stop. WN722N v1 excluded.
